/P 36 0 R
/T (These days remind us that death is not the end. Through Christ we remain one family, the Communion of Saints. Love does not die, and our prayers continue to embrace those who have gone before us. We remember them with gratitude for what they gave us, and we look forward in hope to the day when we shall be reunited in God's presence.)
