/T (As Advent & Christmas approach, our parish church needs decorating for the season. A beautifully lit tree helps make our church a warm and welcoming place for everyone who comes to celebrate the birth of Our Lord. If you would like to sponsor a Christmas tree this year, or share part of its cost, we would be most grateful. Every contribution, large or small, helps. A tree can also be given in memory of a loved one or in thanksgiving for a special intention. If you would like to help, please speak to Fr. Savi or the parish office.)
