558 0 obj
<<
/Title (One of the greatest expressions of that love is the offering of Holy Mass for the faithful departed. From the earliest days of the Church, Catholics have entrusted their loved ones to God's mercy through the Eucharistic sacrifice, praying that they may receive peace, light, and eternal joy. It is a gift far more lasting than flowers or memorial cards.)
